   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": "# Stage 2: Tooth Anomaly Classifier\n\nResNet-18 binary classifier trained on DENTEX Challenge 2023 data.\n\n**Prerequisite:** Run `stage1_segmentation/teeth_segmentation.ipynb` first in the same Kaggle session so that `model` and `test_dataset` are in memory.\n\n**Pipeline role:** Takes each tooth crop from Stage 1 bounding boxes and classifies it as **Normal** or **Anomaly** (Caries / Periapical Lesion / Deep Caries / Impacted Tooth).\n\n**Fixes applied (v2):**\n- Cell 2: auto-detect annotation JSON and image folder — no hardcoded filenames\n- Cell 3: `_label_from_raw` no longer misinterprets COCO category IDs as binary labels\n- Cell 4: image load failure logs a warning instead of silently injecting gray crops\n- Cell 6: removed deprecated `verbose=True` from `ReduceLROnPlateau`\n- Cell 8: training loop streams running confusion-matrix counts — no RAM accumulation\n- Cell 9: AUC-ROC added via sklearn\n- Cell 10: 3-subplot curves (loss, F1, precision/recall)\n- Cell 12: float32 blending with explicit clip to fix uint8 overflow artifacts\n- Cell 13: guard assertions for Stage 1 memory objects",
   "metadata": {}
